    "The purpose of this notebook is to:\n",
    "- Select data from the given data set that is required to answer our business quetions.\n",
    "- Join them if need be.\n",
    "- Clean the data.\n",
    "- Finally save that data as a file that we will use on another notebook to answer our project objectives."
   ]
  },
  {
